When Sherman accidentally rips a hole in the universe by taking the WABAC without permission to impress his
classmate Penny Peterson, they must find themselves to repair history and save the future.

17
01:00:09,230 --> 01:00:15,230
The film was originally planned as a live-action/CG film until it was redeveloped into a fully
computer-animated film in 2006 when Minkoff joined DreamWorks Animation to direct an adaptation.

18
01:03:41,538 --> 01:03:47,538
Andrew Kurtzman was initially set to write the screenplay, based on a pitch
by Minkoff and his longtime producing partner Jason Clark.

19
01:07:13,846 --> 01:07:19,846
Peabody & Sherman was released theatrically in the
United States on March 7, 2014.

20
01:10:46,153 --> 01:10:52,153
Despite grossing $275 million worldwide against a budget of $145
million, the film underperformed by DreamWorks' standards.

21
